# Clicka - Better Fishing Application

## Overview
Clicka - Better Fishing is a comprehensive fishing tracking application built with React, TypeScript, and Supabase. The application helps anglers track their fishing sessions, monitor weather conditions, and analyze their catches across multiple languages (English, Polish, German).

## Core Features

### 1. Session Management
- Start, pause, resume, and end fishing sessions
- Real-time location tracking with multiple sources (GPS, Network, IP)
- Manual waypoint addition
- Offline support with local storage
- Session statistics and analysis
- Multi-language support (EN, PL, DE)

### 2. Catch Recording
- Species selection with size limits
- Length and weight tracking
- Photo capture and storage
- Location and weather data association
- Time of day and moon phase tracking

### 3. Weather Monitoring
- Real-time temperature, pressure, wind tracking
- Cloud cover and precipitation monitoring
- Weather trend visualization
- Pressure trend analysis
- Moon phase calculation

### 4. Location Services
- Multi-source location tracking:
  - GPS with satellite count
  - Network-based location
  - IP-based fallback
- Location accuracy monitoring
- Custom map visualization
- Route tracking and waypoints
- Location permission management

### 5. Data Analysis
- Catch distribution by:
  - Time of day
  - Season
  - Weather conditions
  - Moon phase
- Temperature correlation analysis
- Species distribution
- Success rate analysis

### 6. User Interface
- Clean, modern design with Tailwind CSS
- Responsive layout
- Dark/light theme support
- Interactive maps
- Real-time status indicators
- Custom charts and visualizations

## Technical Architecture

### 1. Frontend
- React with TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS for styling
- React Router for navigation
- Chart.js for data visualization
- Leaflet for maps

### 2. State Management
- Zustand for global state
- React hooks for local state
- Custom hooks for specific features:
  - useGpsTracking
  - useWeather
  - useActiveSession
  - useSettings

### 3. Database
- Supabase backend
- Tables:
  - fishing_sessions
  - fish_catches
  - fish_species
- Row Level Security (RLS)
- Real-time sync

### 4. Storage
- Local storage for offline support
- IndexedDB for large datasets
- File storage for photos
- Automatic sync when online

### 5. External Services
- Weather API integration
- Map services
- Geolocation services
- Time/date handling

